WEBVTT

00:01.570 --> 00:08.080
<b>This is JF Notes, your client hub in the trainer portal. Every client has a card.</b>

00:08.080 --> 00:18.390
<b>From home, open your Deals list. This is every client in your funnel, grouped by stage.</b>

00:18.390 --> 00:30.800
<b>Need someone fast? Hit Control K, type their name, and jump straight to their card.</b>

00:30.800 --> 00:43.480
<b>Here is the full story. Status at the top, and every session note in the activity feed. Read it before you act.</b>

00:43.480 --> 01:08.940
<b>After every session, leave a note. Tap the comment box and write what happened and what is next.</b>

01:08.940 --> 01:14.400
<b>Hit send, and it is on the record for the whole team.</b>

01:14.400 --> 01:21.870
<b>That is JF Notes. Open the card, read the story, leave your note. Every session, every time.</b>
